# Round 9 (18 Oct): written from scratch for FLUX.2 klein, prose ordered subject > setting > details > light > style.
# From the owner's notes: Battle of Coruscant and Taris' bombardment, the Yuuzhan Vong doing the destruction, their
# living ships (mostly cetus-like, also jellyfish and squid), the Legends ship classes, the Republic fleet exploding,
# more Star Wars; Yuuzhan Vong and Zonama Sekot (living worlds, scarring, a galaxy that fractured).
P1="A wide cinematic Star Wars Legends space battle in orbit above Coruscant, the planet-wide city glowing with fires. The Yuuzhan Vong invasion fleet fills the upper half of the frame. At its centre floats a colossal worldship: a living disc of pale bone-white yorik coral and black volcanic rock, its rim curling into spiral arms like a hurricane, its surface crowded with coral spires and glowing magma vents. Around it swim living warships grown from coral: long cetacean-like cruisers with craggy barnacled hides, glowing red scars along their flanks and squid-like tentacles trailing beneath; reddish-black spearhead gunships; glossy black pyramid corvettes; and swarms of small triangular coralskipper fighters. The Vong ships spit molten magma boulders, and small black gravity voids hang in front of them swallowing turbolaser fire. In the foreground the New Republic fleet is dying: an Imperial-class Star Destroyer broken in half and exploding, a rounded Mon Calamari cruiser burning, X-wing starfighters streaking past firing red lasers, debris and escape pods everywhere. Orange firelight against deep blue space, strong rim light, volumetric smoke. Photorealistic concept art matte painting. The bottom third is darker and calmer. No text, no logos."
P2="A wide cinematic Star Wars Legends scene: the orbital bombardment of a city-covered planet, seen from high in its burning sky. Living Yuuzhan Vong warships descend through towering smoke: long cetacean-like coral cruisers with craggy pale hides, glowing red scar patterns and jellyfish tendrils, reddish-black spearhead gunships, and swarms of small triangular coral fighters. They rain glowing magma onto endless skyscrapers, which collapse into molten craters and spreading rivers of fire. Above them a shattered moon breaks into burning fragments. New Republic ships fight back and die: a grey wedge-shaped Star Destroyer plunging in flames, X-wing starfighters firing red lasers, Corellian corvettes exploding. Dusk light, orange fire against a bruised purple and blue sky, volumetric smoke. Photorealistic concept art matte painting. The bottom third is darker and calmer. No text, no logos."
P3="A wide cinematic Star Wars Legends space battle beside a planet that is cracking apart, glowing magma splitting its continents and city lights. In front of it the Yuuzhan Vong fleet advances: a colossal spiral-armed worldship of pale yorik coral and volcanic rock, long cetacean-like coral cruisers with squid tentacles and glowing red scars, glossy black pyramid corvettes, reddish-black spearhead gunships, swarms of triangular coralskipper fighters hurling magma. The New Republic fleet breaks against it: Star Destroyers split in half and exploding in huge fireballs, Mon Calamari cruisers burning, X-wings and A-wings weaving through debris. Silvery storm clouds spiral across the dying planet. Deep space, orange fire and magma light, strong rim light. Photorealistic concept art matte painting. The bottom third is darker and calmer. No text, no logos."
